      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "This is something that should 100% be reverted back. I don't think there should some other work around as it worked just fine before. As i remember if you wanted to keep the state you could hit r and it wouldn't set it back to the default animation. If you wanted to reset the animation you could just left click and it would close that puppet and go back to normal. I'm not sure if this was intended but it should be changed back.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
