      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "so it isnt just me\nI could have sworn you could do things like puppeteering and speed dials on an animation and then have it continue when you closed out the menu, much like animation toggles now work\ni thought I imagined this change",
