  "companyID": "58c62e995865713647a7115d",
  "created": "2020-08-14T23:58:08.385Z",
  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The new update changed that you cannot close the menu with your last position of your puppeteering saved. I used to be able to make my legs go a certain position and then just close the menu aswell\nexample: https://gyazo.com/8724dc709d6bdc4cbe40c1dc4ed11bc7\nI would love to see that reverted to\nmy idea would be\nDesktop:\nrightclick > close puppeteering\nR > hide menu but still keep the state of the puppeteering active\nVR:\nclick button again > close puppeteering\nhold menu button > hide menu but still keep the state of the puppeteering active\nthis makes it really bad if you want to have multiple possible states/positions you want to keep",
